invariant: INV-37
file: Makefile
catches: test/pinned-checkers.sh
reason: lint-tidy stops checking that its clang-tidy is the pinned
  version. A catch script runs lint-tidy alone, without lint-toolchain,
  so on a runner whose clang-tidy is 18 it takes that version's verdict:
  clang-tidy 18 rejects .clang-tidy, runs none of its checks and exits 0
  on broken code. test/pinned-checkers.sh hands lint-tidy an older and a
  newer stand-in and requires it to stop on the pin.

--- old
	$(call REQUIRE_PINNED,lint-tidy,$(CLANG_TIDY),version $(LLVM_MAJOR)\.,LLVM $(LLVM_MAJOR))
--- new
